# Landing page configuration. Copy to .env and edit.
#
# .env does NOT go into the repository: each environment (testnet, staging,
# mainnet) points at a different explorer, and the URL should not live in the
# HTML.
#
# No trailing slash. The values below are the real ones for the public
# deployment, so a local render works straight after the copy. Change them for
# a fork or a staging environment; render.sh still refuses an empty value,
# because a page shipped with an unstamped link is a defect nobody notices
# until somebody clicks, and the click is what the page exists to provoke.
#
# The explorer URL is not here. It is written into the HTML instead -- see the
# note at the top of render.sh.

# Where the download buttons point. The releases page rather than a single
# archive: a release publishes two tiers for several platforms, the file names
# carry the version, and a link to one file is a link that rots at the next tag.
ZYCORD_RELEASES_URL=https://github.com/Zycord/zycord-node/releases/latest

# Where "View Source Code" points.
ZYCORD_SOURCE_URL=https://github.com/Zycord/zycord-node
